{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage", "label": "D2 \u2014 R\u00e8gles du jeu et d'arbitrage", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_score_brut", "label": "Score brut s (moyenne mouthSmileLeft/Right)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mesure simple disponible partout ; liss\u00e9e sur 200 ms pour qu'une image bruit\u00e9e ne d\u00e9cide pas. \u00c0 confirmer (P0)."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_variante_cheeksquint", "label": "Variante du score cheekSquint", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a75.5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Test\u00e9e en P0 \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de la formule de base pour r\u00e9duire les faux positifs dus \u00e0 la parole, sans la remplacer (n\u00b0 72)."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_seuil_propre_joueur", "label": "Seuil propre au joueur d = min(k \u00d7 (v \u2212 n), d_max)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a75.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un seuil fixe est injuste : l'amplitude mesur\u00e9e varie selon le visage (barbe, bouche relev\u00e9e). k = 0,5 \u00c0 confirmer (P0)."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_d_max", "label": "Seuil maximal d_max = 0,35", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a73, \u00a75.2, \u00a77 Q1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Parade provisoire contre l'exag\u00e9ration du sourire volontaire qui rel\u00e8verait le seuil. Question ouverte Q1, \u00c0 confirmer (P0)."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_jauge", "label": "Jauge J et pic de jauge", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a74.3 R3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "J normalis\u00e9e par le seuil propre au joueur pour \u00eatre comparable ; fig\u00e9e sur image invalide ; pic remis \u00e0 z\u00e9ro \u00e0 chaque manche."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_fenetre_effective_w", "label": "Fen\u00eatre effective W = max(200 ms, 2 \u00d7 e)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a74.5 R5, \u00a75.6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La latence r\u00e9seau (50 \u00e0 150 ms, asym\u00e9trique) est du m\u00eame ordre que 200 ms ; W recalcul\u00e9e avant chaque r\u00e9v\u00e9lation. \u00c0 confirmer (P1)."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_image_valide", "label": "Image valide / invalide", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a74.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exactement un visage, largeur \u2265 20 %, lacet \u2264 25\u00b0, tangage \u2264 20\u00b0. Deux visages = invalide pour emp\u00eacher de se faire remplacer (n\u00b0 67)."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_faute", "label": "Faute (sourire confirm\u00e9 ou deuxi\u00e8me perte)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_aucun_enregistrement", "label": "Aucun enregistrement (aucun stockage persistant)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a74.7 R7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "M\u00e9moire vive permise ; ni disque, ni stockage navigateur, ni serveur (n\u00b0 26, n\u00b0 69)."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_tableau_reglages", "label": "Tableau des r\u00e9glages d'arbitrage", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Valeurs de d\u00e9part (hypoth\u00e8ses ou source) modifiables apr\u00e8s tests, chacune marqu\u00e9e \u00c0 confirmer (P0/P1/P2)."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_r1_calibrage", "label": "R1 \u2014 Calibrage (neutre 3 s + sourire 2 s)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.1 R1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Une fois par match ; rejet sur pr\u00e9sence, largeur, angles, luminance, \u00e9cart-type, neutre trop haut, amplitude trop faible ; premi\u00e8re cause affich\u00e9e, essais illimit\u00e9s."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_r2_detection_sourire", "label": "R2 \u2014 D\u00e9tection du sourire (s\u00e9rie \u2265 400 ms, \u2265 3 images)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.2 R2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dur\u00e9e ind\u00e9pendante de la cadence ; horodatage \u00e0 la premi\u00e8re image de la s\u00e9rie pour dater le sourire \u00e0 son apparition ; une image non souriante tol\u00e9r\u00e9e."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_r3_zone_doute_jauge", "label": "R3 \u2014 Zone de doute et jauge", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.3 R3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Aucune p\u00e9nalit\u00e9 en zone de doute (n\u00b0 20) ; le pic sert au d\u00e9partage."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_r4_visage_perdu", "label": "R4 \u2014 Visage perdu (1,5 s, 2 pertes, 5 s continues)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.4 R4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Emp\u00eache d'\u00e9chapper au jugement en sortant du champ ; pas d'exception pour cause technique (limite accept\u00e9e, \u00a75.3)."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_r5_simultaneite", "label": "R5 \u2014 Horodatage et simultan\u00e9it\u00e9", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.5 R5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "D\u00e9cision identique sur les deux appareils ; fautes \u00e0 moins de W = manche nulle rejou\u00e9e ; s'applique \u00e0 toute faute."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_r6_departage", "label": "R6 \u2014 D\u00e9partage \u00e0 60 s par pic de jauge", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.6 R6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Perd le pic le plus haut ; \u00e9cart < 0,05 = manche nulle (un \u00e9cart infime ne d\u00e9partage pas honn\u00eatement, n\u00b0 68)."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_r7_arret_sur_image", "label": "R7 \u2014 Arr\u00eat sur image (image de preuve)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.7 R7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Image de la cam\u00e9ra locale au score le plus haut de la s\u00e9rie, nette et exacte contrairement au flux re\u00e7u retard\u00e9 et compress\u00e9 ; en m\u00e9moire vive jusqu'\u00e0 la fin du match."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_main_devant_bouche", "label": "Main devant la bouche \u2014 limite accept\u00e9e v1", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a75.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Co\u00fbt d'une deuxi\u00e8me analyse ; entre amis l'adversaire voit la main. Hand Landmarker en dette technique si P0 montre une triche fr\u00e9quente."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_mediapipe_face_landmarker", "label": "MediaPipe Face Landmarker", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_hand_landmarker", "label": "Hand Landmarker (dette technique)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a75.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_q1_plafond_seuil", "label": "Q1 \u2014 Plafonner le seuil \u00e0 d_max ?", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a77 Q1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage", "target": "docs_d1_note_de_cadrage", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "en-t\u00eate", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage", "target": "sources_cadrage_lots_1_2_3", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "en-t\u00eate \u00a73.4", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage", "target": 